    category: "Scholarships",
    excerpt: "Qatar University 2026 Graduate Scholarships for International Students | Fully Funded Qatar University is offering fully-funded Graduate Scholarships for international students to pursue Master’s and PhD programs in Qatar. Here are the details: Eligibility Criteria: Master’s Applicants: Bachelor’s degree with a minimum GPA of 2.8 PhD Applicants: Master’s degree with a minimum GPA of 3.0 Standardized test […]",
    content: "<p><strong>Qatar University 2026 Graduate Scholarships for International Students | Fully Funded</strong></p>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xzzxbak\"><span>Qatar University is offering fully-funded Graduate Scholarships for international students to pursue Master’s and PhD programs in Qatar. Here are the details:</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr xzzxbak\"><span><b>Eligibility Criteria:</b></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span><b>Master’s Applicants:</b> Bachelor’s degree with a minimum GPA of 2.8</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span><b>PhD Applicants:</b> Master’s degree with a minimum GPA of 3.0</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Standardized test scores (e.g., GRE, GMAT) required for PhD programs</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr xzzxbak\"><span><b>Benefits:</b></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Full tuition fee exemption</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Monthly living salary</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Student housing (two students per room)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Annual round-trip airfare ticket</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Residence permit under QU sponsorship</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Exemption from textbook fees</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr xzzxbak\"><span><b>Required Documents:</b></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Application Form</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>High school transcripts</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Two Recommendation Letters</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Passport Photo Page</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>English proficiency certificate (TOEFL or IELTS, optional)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Standardized test scores (for PhD applicants)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr xzzxbak\"><span><b>Application Process:</b></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Submit online admission application</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Receive acknowledgment letter</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Application review and interview</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Submit official documents</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig xgwjfdz xmyy1pt x1jdczeh\"><span>Receive admissions decision</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr xzzxbak\"><span><b>Deadline:</b> February 25, 2026</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr\"><span>Apply now and take the first step towards your academic dreams in Qatar.</span></div>\n<div class=\"xe0n8xf x12d4x0i x1d5s5ig x1cgcltr\"><span><a href=\"https://www.successtonicsblog.com/2025/12/apply-now-qatar-university-2026-graduate-scholarships-for-international-students-fully-funded\">Apply Now! Qatar University 2026 Graduate Scholarships for International Students | Fully Funded | Success Tonics Blog</a></span></div>\n</div>",
